@@ -8,6 +8,11 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Tool input schemas are checked when static tools are registered, so an invalid schema fails at startup with the tool name in the error.
+- Tool calls with invalid input now return a readable tool result before the executor runs, allowing the assistant to correct its call. Function-backed tools use the schema returned for each call.
+
